These line icons are Lucide's (https://lucide.dev), release 1.48.0: each is
rendered from the SVG vendored unmodified in assets/icons/lucide/, by
tools/lineicons.py, at 15, 19, 23 and 30 pixels, keeping only its coverage.
Their terms are Lucide's - ISC, and MIT for the icons Lucide derived from
Feather - in assets/icons/lucide/LICENSE, which applies to these pictures as
it does to the vectors they were made from.

Until 26 September 2026 this folder held 26 icons drawn for Kosmos by hand,
Kosmos. Copyright (c) 2026 Diego Cibils, MIT; they are in the repository's
history.
